# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Processed before static files.
#
# Old WX4PTC URL that NWS and other pages still link to. The target has no
# .html on purpose: Pages answers /wx4ptc.html with a 308 back to /wx4ptc,
# so pointing a rule at /wx4ptc.html would loop.
/wx4ptc/             /wx4ptc  301
/wx4ptc/index.html   /wx4ptc  301
